{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"steinerTree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"terminals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/SteinerTree","text":"SteinerTree","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SpanningTrees11SteinerTreeV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdditiveArithmetic","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Comparable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The vertices to connect.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"terminals"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each edge’s weight, from its position.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"weight"}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tree’s edges, in position order, and their total weight.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One Dijkstra search from all terminals at once assigns every vertex to its nearest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"terminal. Each edge between two terminals’ regions joins them at the length of the path"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through it, a minimum spanning tree of those joins picks which regions to connect, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tree is the picked edges with the shortest paths from their ends to their terminals. Its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"weight is at most 2(1 − 1\/ℓ) times the optimum, where ℓ is the number of leaves of an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"optimal tree. Every leaf is a terminal."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Repeated terminals count once. With fewer than two terminals the tree has no edges. Every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge that is not a self-loop is weighed once; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weight"},{"type":"text","text":" is not kept."}]},{"style":"note","name":"Complexity","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(m log m)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"style":"note","name":"Precondition","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every terminal is a vertex; every weight is at least zero and not NaN; the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"path lengths do not overflow.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/spanningtrees\/graphprotocols\/graph\/steinertree(terminals:weight:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An approximate minimum Steiner tree connecting "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"terminals"},{"type":"text","text":", by Mehlhorn’s algorithm; nil"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when two terminals are in different components."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/steinerTree(terminals:weight:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"SpanningTrees"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"steinerTree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"terminals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ST","text":"Sequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"tex